ΔH = ΔH(formation of [FeCl4]2-) - ΔH(hydration of Fe2+) - 2ΔH(hydration of Cl-)

ΔH = (-392 kJ/mol) - (-340 kJ/mol) - 2(-381 kJ/mol)

ΔH = -392 kJ/mol + 340 kJ/mol + 762 kJ/mol

ΔH = 700 kJ/mol

