\int_{0}^{1}\left(3 e^{x}+2 \sqrt{x}\right) d x = \left[ 3e^x + 4\sqrt{x} \right]_{0}^{1} = (3e^1 + 4\sqrt{1}) - (3e^0 + 4\sqrt{0}) = (3e + 4) - (3 + 0) = 3e + 1.
