   - Cross-sectional-sectional section (A) of the tube = π * (D/2)² = π * (10⁻4 m /2)² = π × 10⁻8 m²
   - Velocity (v) = Q/A = (10 × 10⁻⁶ m³/s) / (π × 10⁻8 m²) ≈ 3.12 × 10 m/s

