This reaction is a redox reaction where:
- **Positive cell (positive side):** \( 2\text{PbO}_2 + 4\text{H}^+ + 4\text{e}^- \rightarrow 2\text{PbSO}_4 + 2\text{H}_2\text{O} \) (oxidation of lead dioxide)
