     \]
   - The mass of TNT required is:
     \[
     \text{Mass of TNT} = \frac{\text{Energy of HMTA explosion}}{\text{Energy per gram of TNT}} = \frac{14285 \text{ J}}{3204 \text{ J/g}} = 4.44 \text{ g}
