   \[
   0 = 90 \text{ kg m/s} + 5.97 \times 10^{24} \text{ kg} \times v_{\text{earth}}
   \]
   - Solving for \( v_{\text{earth}} \):
   \[
   v_{\text{earth}} = \frac{-90 \text{ kg m/s}}{5.97 \times 10^{24} \text{ kg}} = -1.53 \times 10^{-23} \text{ m/s}
   \]

