\[
\delta = \frac{1}{4\pi \sqrt{2}} \left( \frac{1}{2 \times 25^2} \right) \times 12.5^2
\]  
\[
\delta = \frac{1}{4\pi \sqrt{2}} \left( \frac{1}{2 \times 625} \right) \times 155
\]  
\[
\delta = \frac{1}{4\pi \sqrt{2}} \times \frac{1}{1250} \times 155
\]  
\[
\delta = \frac{155}{4\pi \sqrt{2} \times 1250}
\]  
\[
\delta = \frac{155}{31715} \approx 0.00488 \, \text{cm}
\]  

Thus, the spherical aberration of the mirror is \(\boxed{0.00488 \, \text{cm}}\).
